    if(page==='inventory')html+=card('Stock adjustment history','<div id="adjustment"></div>'+table(['Recorded','Item','Change','Unit','User','Reason'],[...state.adjustments].reverse().map(a=>`<tr><td>${esc(when(a))}</td><td>${esc(a.name)}</td><td>${a.delta}</td><td>${esc(a.unit||'Legacy unit unknown')}</td><td>${esc(a.actor||'Legacy user unknown')}</td><td>${esc(a.reason)}</td></tr>`)));
